s tend to get strange after hours. Management decided it’s far cheaper to hire a night guard (that’s you) than to deal with whatever’s causing it.\n\nFrom your cramped security office, you’ll need to monitor the building using a network of cameras. But be careful—you only have a limited amount of power each night (thanks to recent budget cuts). Once it’s gone, so are your lights and doors… and your safety.\n\nIf something seems off—like a character not being where they should be—you’ll need to track them down on the cameras and defend yourself however you can.\n\nCan you survive a week of Brainrot Nights?","path":"/game/100635310803794-brainrot-nights-five-nights-at-brainrot-pizzeria","slug":"100635310803794-brainrot-nights-five-nights-at-brainrot-pizzeria","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/caa759ee1f2a2ae7c17548c6497090118d4b196584090da76901b6afd1a1a255.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ac2d8875b625e449284ba1f09aa0efb1/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":7277,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-13T07:01:47.831Z","creator":{"name":"B_Ketchup","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":17574618959,"name":"Just a baseplate.","desc":"","path":"/game/17574618959-just-a-baseplate","slug":"17574618959-just-a-baseplate","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/a3bd101408e064dd8ef2027bac045b9b1837aa534216c51faa628d07b64ec2ca.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-33425c7475f4de0d1079227fd904378c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-10-01T23:59:04.509Z","creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":130,"freeCount":130,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":9887114004,"name":"Steal a Brainrot ","desc":"🔥 VILLAGE VS ZOMBIE 🔥\n¡El caos ha comenzado! 🧟‍♂️💥\nUn tranquilo pueblo ha sido invadido por hordas de zombis y solo tú puedes detenerlos.\n\n🏡 Defiende el pueblo\n⚔️ Lucha contra zombis cada vez más fuertes\